   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VIE Demo Environment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">VIE DemoMilj&#xF6;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through call for applications partners in Sweden, in cooperation with partners in India, Indonesia, China, Vietnam, Botswana, Namibia and   South Africa, are given an opportunity to carry out (i) demonstration projects and (ii) planning grant projects in the area of  environment and climate, which have the potential to lead to long-term            sustainable development not funded by development cooperation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Via ett utlysningsprogram ges akt&#xF6;rer i Sverige i samarbete med       akt&#xF6;rer i Indien,Indonesien, Kina, Vietnam, Botswana, Namibia och     Sydafrika m&#xF6;jlighet att genomf&#xF6;ra (i) demonstrationsprojekt samt (ii) projekt med planeringsbidrag inom omr&#xE5;det milj&#xF6; och klimat som p&#xE5;     sikt kan f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntas leda till l&#xE5;ngsiktig h&#xE5;llbar samverkan utan        fortsatt finansiering fr&#xE5;n bist&#xE5;ndsanslaget.</narrative>
  </description>
